1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:03,350
In five seconds, the Moon stops orbiting Earth.

2
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:05,350
And starts to fall.

3
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:07,150
What the...

4
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:13,300
The first thing it pulls on is the water.

5
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:16,900
O Allah.

6
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:20,840
You run for the subway.

7
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:25,840
O Allah, make this easy for me.

8
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:29,760
Then the water starts climbing… up the stairs.

9
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:37,440
Across the street, a taxi lifts off the road.

10
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,000
O Allah.

11
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:42,700
Above you, the Moon is breaking apart.

12
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:45,280
Hold on to something.

13
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,360
The pieces start to fall.

14
00:00:58,420 --> 00:01:01,660
Now the buildings are being pulled into the sky.

15
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:08,100
O Allah

16
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:09,500
The railing is holding you.

17
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:11,460
It's starting to bend.

18
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:18,500
I bear witness that there is no deity except Allah,

19
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:22,500
and I bear witness that Muhammad is His servant and Messenger.
